子、菌丝、隐血均未见或阴性，检验建议无特殊", "impression": null, "source": 1, "status": 1, "extra": null, "created_at": "2026-05-18T14:14:25.011811Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-18T14:14:25.011829Z", "attachments": [{"id": 409, "file_uuid": "6647d787-7d1d-41bc-b673-e776395378f3", "original_name": "photo_33354EA8-7C0E-4A7E-971D-6876EB7E6FD7.jpg", "file_size": 660716, "mime_type": "image/jpeg", "file_md5": "e3086cf080cb57da5dee63211a761de0", "business_type": "examination_report", "business_id": "83", "object_key": "SparkClient/20260518/6647D787-7D1D-41BC-B673-E776395378F3/photo_33354EA8-7C0E-4A7E-971D-6876EB7E6FD7.jpg", "storage_type": "oss", "created_at": "2026-05-18T14:11:08.163874Z", "file_url": "https://zhaodkdream.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/SparkClient/20260518/6647D787-7D1D-41BC-B673-E776395378F3/photo_33354EA8-7C0E-4A7E-971D-6876EB7E6FD7.jpg"}]}, {"id": 82, "user": 3, "member": 13, "medical_record": 34, "category": "imaging", "sub_category": "", "item_name": "苏州工业园区星塘医院放射科颈椎椎间盘平扫+头颅平扫报告", "performed_at": "2025-06-04T00:00:00Z", "reported_at": null, "organization_name": "苏州工业园区星塘医院", "department_name": "", "doctor_name": "天聚定", "findings": "头颅CT平扫示脑实质未见明显异常密度影，各脑室形态大小正常，脑沟、裂池未见明显异常，中线结构居中。小脑及脑干未见异常密度影。鼻咽顶后壁软组织增厚。颈椎序列整齐，生理曲度平直，椎体缘可见骨质增生，椎小关节突对称，C4/5、C5/6椎间盘稍向后突出，相邻硬膜囊稍受压：骨性椎管无明显狭窄，椎旁软组织无明显肿胀。两侧颈部、颌下区多发小淋巴结。所示右侧声带相对稍厚。影像诊断：1.头颅CT平扫未见明显异常，必要时MRI检查。鼻咽顶后壁软组织增厚，请结合专科检查。2.C4/5、C5/6椎间盘轻微突出：颈椎失稳；两侧颈部、颌下区多发小淋巴结。所示右侧声带相对稍厚。", "impression": null, "source": 1, "status": 1, "extra": null, "created_at": "2026-05-18T14:14:24.997274Z", "updated_at": "2026-05-18T14:14:24.997288Z", "attachments": [{"id": 408, "file_uuid": "af62fedc-800b-4185-bb16-7214b09b3ced", "original_name": "photo_26B8A7DC-023D-4BF6-87AF-2E4C9F96202D.jpg", "file_size": 569100, "mime_type": "image/jpeg", "file_md5": "88e627ff89739dafbe39c6c96b3d7458", "business_type": "examination_report", "business_id": "82", "object_key": "SparkClient/20260518/AF62FEDC-800B-4185-BB16-7214B09B3CED/photo_26B8A7DC-023D-4BF6-87AF-2E4C9F96202D.jpg", "sto